# Insights API conventions

- Keep pipeline stages in separate modules: `ingest`, `interpret`, `explain`, `render`, `personalize`, `narrative`.
- Pydantic models should mirror `packages/schemas` JSON Schema fields.
- Agent prompts must request structured outputs (headline, why_it_matters, evidence).
- Prefer dependency-injected Azure OpenAI clients so tests can mock LLM calls.
- Aggregation logic must be unit-tested against fixtures in `data/synthetic/`.
